  "title": "Envela to Announce Third Quarter 2025 Financial Results on November 5",
  "summary": "IRVING, TX / ACCESS Newswire / October 23, 2025 / Envela Corporation announced today that it plans to report its financial results for the third quarter of 2025 after the market closes on Wednesday, November 5, 2025. Envela periodically provides information for investors on its corporate website, envela.com. This includes press releases, quarterly investor presentations […]",
